OL,3,GNEWSANHS boss tells Eljamel inquiry: 'I
OL,4,Awon't resign over destroyed logbooks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicky Connor told the inquiry that she
OL,7,Faccepted the failing had "compounded
OL,8,Fand exacerbated distress" for
OL,9,Fpatients."
